{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I hope it would be better then the scholars were.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:26:14.742000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738417179590131833","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"“The scholars. What did they do?”","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:26:38.819000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738417280576258079","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I always had enough to eat and a bed to sleep in. No one beat me, but I was trained for war.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:26:52.449000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738417337744752650","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"They started so young. Tabaxi are quite uncommon in London. So I was a valuable asset.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:27:44.900000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738417557739929602","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"“I’m sorry.”","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:28:02.292000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738417630687527022","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"The kinship makes sense now. Arc’s life was planned out for them and they’d never had any control before their freedom with Cato","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:28:31.314000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738417752414617650","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"It wasn't terrible. I made a good friend, Elith. He was an elf ranger boy we got along great. Chasing eachother throughout the halls. Hiding on roof tops\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:30:03.716000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738418139976564867","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"“I’m glad you remember him.”","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:30:22.307000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738418217952870503","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"The ooze only takes proud memories\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:30:51.155000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738418338950152254","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"...","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:31:00.665000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738418378837983283","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"When I was thirteen, I got my first real assignment. Me and Elith were to be scouts together against a group of orcs.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:31:51.413000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738418591690522705","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"Arc sees where this is going","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:32:42.751000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738418807017570487","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"It was going to be difficult. There was to be 5 miles between us at all times to cover more ground. I found the orc camp but got overconfident and got trapped there.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:33:08.241000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738418913930641409","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"Stuck in a tree no way to move forward or backwards. So I just stayed.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:33:48.595000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738419083187454134","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"At the very least if they started to move I knew I would be faster, and could escape\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:34:40.372000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738419300356063313","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I was stuck in that tree for five days. Ran out of water on the third.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:35:13.425000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738419438990393446","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"On the fifth day, I was so weak. But I couldn't ruin out mission by leaving, even though I would have lived.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:36:25.683000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738419742062149672","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I fell asleep. On my post.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:36:44.569000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738419821275774987","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"When I woke the camp was deserted.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:37:13.797000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738419943866892309","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I ran so fast. I called out for Elith, following the destruction of the orcs through the trees.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:38:07.682000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738420169877094481","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I found him.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:38:18.538000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738420215410327612","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"Or atleast. His head. On a pike.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:38:34.373000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738420281827393576","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"“I’m sorry.”","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:38:48.667000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738420341780512958","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"Sorry.. I never told anyone the full story before.\" He is crying","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:39:22.359000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738420483095003157","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I have held onto it for so long.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:39:34.671000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738420534735536159","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"They climb up onto his bunk, move his platter of food, and wrap their arms around him.","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:40:15.949000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738420707867754496","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"He begins to sob at the affection","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:40:48.096000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738420842702045256","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"Stroking behind his ears with his face in their chest, they whisper, “You’re the bravest man I know. We’re gonna work through this. It was not your fault. It’s okay to let it out. It’s okay to cry. I love you.”","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:41:25.669000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738421000294629389","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"He holds them tightly just letting the emotions wash over him.","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:42:25.481000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738421251164602510","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"“Hey, it’s alright. You’re safe. Your friends are safe.” They continue to hold him.","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:43:06.546000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738421423403565137","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I could have done more. Been faster, smarter, braver. I fucked it all up.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:44:01.711000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738421654782476379","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"“We all have made mistakes. We all think we could have done better. But we didn’t. I once told you what a wise man once told me: we can’t change the past with tears. We can only change the future with our actions. It’s alright. It’s alright we’re gonna get past this, okay?”","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:45:58.321000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738422143880265738","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"Thank you Arc. For being here.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:47:34.273000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738422546332123176","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"“Don’t mention it.”","created_at":"2020-07-30T15:48:35.246000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738422802071158845","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
